  "case": "cn-n-role-rename-business-lane",
  "clause": "DESIGN R3.3 §7.2 External membership; §4.1 external/internal/incomplete calls; §4.4; §13 OPEN-EXTERNAL, OPEN-SHARING; §16 items 2, 4; §7.3 external/internal/incomplete calls, role reorder/rename",
