  "profile": "cn-n",
  "derivation": "Call_ext carries exactly one marker of the candidate encoding (text external, no calledElement) and belongs to no lane: under activation=qualification (fixtures may exercise the candidate encoding, §4.1) appendUnique adds it to the bound external lane. Call_int (internal target) and Call_inc (incomplete) stay untouched in Lane_zeta, whose stored member order [Call_int, Call_inc, Task_E] and the lane order [Lane_zeta, Lane_alpha, Lane_ext] are preserved. No membership is removed, so the responsibility check is not involved. Lane_alpha is renamed: supports are found by binding, never by name, so the output differs from cn-n-external-membership-append only by that name. Report header (H B4): sourceIdentity and targetIdentity are the envelope identity, inputRevision is baseRevision, outputRevision is revision.",
